# inner_product smoke — PR gate: MB/OC/K scan, K tails, degenerate shapes
#
# Shape column = the case's GEMM projection: MxNxK with
#   M = mb, N = oc, K = the folded reduction
# and no params column (the descriptor is exactly the shape triple). src is
# [mb][k], w is [oc][k] row-major and dst is [mb][oc].
#
# f32 differential comparison relies on the scalar golden contracting
# `acc += a * b` into an FMA exactly like the vector kernels do; a compiler
# that vectorizes the golden into a non-fused form can land 1 ulp off and
# report a pre-existing f32 failure (same as the matmul and conv2d corpora).
4x3x7 n"small"
1x1x1 n"single"
16x8x24 n"mb_scan_a"
7x13x40 n"oc_tail"
3x5x17 n"k_tail"
